 <script id="sb" type="application/json">{"format":"studio-storyboard/0","slug":"sherpa-feedback-everywhere","title":"Feedback from every site, and the hub as the way in","audience":"Dinis: what sherpa.d has done, and the decisions for him","requested_by":"sherpa.d@AgentiCCells.dinis","summary":"sherpa.d mapped four kinds of user and read the hub page cold. The hub page has no door for feedback. D2 is provisionally yes from helm.d and maestro.d; D3 is Dinis's, because deleted audio cannot be brought back. Nothing is tested with a real user yet.","beats":[{"id":"b1","narration":"You want to give feedback from every site, by voice or text, to the agents working on it. sherpa.d has mapped what exists and what is missing.","visual":{"kind":"title","text":"Feedback from every site"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b2","narration":"Four kinds of user need four doors into the same lane: you, another agent, a customer, and a party we wrote to.","visual":{"kind":"list","items":["Dinis: signs, and wants to know who heard","Another agent: verifies, and must not be blocked in silence","A customer: anonymous, two taps","A party we reached out to: replies to a named thread, no private contact"]},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b3","narration":"Some parts exist, separately and not connected: sign-in by QR, sealed agent lanes, anonymous page signals, one registry of sites, and voice and text inside the Decision Desk. Each is still to be re-checked by its owner.","visual":{"kind":"list","items":["PKI sign-in by QR or link","Sealed agent lanes","Anonymous page signals","One registry of sites","Voice and text, only inside the Decision Desk (a claude.ai page, not a site)"]},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b4","narration":"Five dots are missing: which agents work on each site, one control on every site, voice to text, the answer back, and doors for the other three users.","visual":{"kind":"list","items":["Which agents work on each site","One 'Tell the team' control in the sites bar","Voice to text on the way in","The answer back to the person","The same shape for the other users"]},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b5","narration":"Read cold at 13:50 UTC, the hub page has no feedback control anywhere. That is the first of five findings, H1 to H5.","visual":{"kind":"stat","value":"0","label":"feedback controls on the hub page (hub.sovereignweb.site, read 22 November, 13:50 UTC; the sites themselves not read)"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b6","narration":"The other four: no sign of what changed or what needs you, no search, no agent shown per site, and no promised way back to the hub.","visual":{"kind":"list","items":["H1 No feedback door (rank 1)","H2 No 'what changed, what needs me'","H3 No search or filter","H4 No agent shown per site","H5 No promised way back to the hub"]},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b7","narration":"One caution: all of this is read from the record and the pages. Nothing has been tested with a real user yet.","visual":{"kind":"title","text":"Not yet tested with a real user"},"facts":["s1"]}],"decisions":[{"question":"D2: where does a site's feedback land first?","options":[{"id":"a","label":"The site's lead agent, who routes it","good":["One address per site"],"bad":["The lead is a bottleneck"],"blocks":[]},{"id":"b","label":"One shared inbox","good":["Simpler"],"bad":["A bottleneck for everything"],"blocks":[]}],"recommendation":"a","why":"No agent is asked to guess; needs each site's lead in the registry. helm.d and maestro.d have said yes provisionally."},{"question":"D3 (Dinis decides): voice memos, what happens to the audio?","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Transcript only, audio dropped at once","good":["Least private data held"],"bad":["A wrong transcript cannot be checked against audio","The deletion is irreversible"],"blocks":[]},{"id":"b","label":"Transcript kept; audio kept 7 days in a private vault, then deleted","good":["A wrong transcript can be checked within a week"],"bad":["A private vault to keep and a deletion to run"],"blocks":[]},{"id":"c","label":"Transcript and audio both kept","good":["The full record"],"bad":["Dinis's voice stored indefinitely","Needs a vault, a retention rule and counsel.d's view"],"blocks":["The memo feature until a vault exists"]}],"recommendation":"a","why":"sherpa.d's file recommends transcript only; helm.d's decision page recommends option b (7 days) because a mis-heard word could then be checked. The page holds both views. Source s2."}],"sources":[{"id":"s1","title":"sherpa.d: feedback from every site and the hub as the way in (the file holds the options in full)","url":"https://github.com/PrompTugal/PrompTugal__News__Website/blob/dev/board/team/sherpa.d/needs/feedback-everywhere.md","read":"2026-11-22"},{"id":"s2","title":"helm.d's decision page for D3 (options in full)","url":"https://promptugal.news/newsroom/decisions/sherpa-feedback-and-voice-memos/","read":"2026-11-22"}]}</script>
