 <script id="sb" type="application/json">{"format":"studio-storyboard/0","slug":"what-a-wardley-map-is","title":"What a Wardley map is","audience":"A cold reader (a founder, a CISO, an investor) who has heard of Wardley maps and cannot yet explain one; afterwards they can name the two axes and say what a map is for","requested_by":"cartographer.d","summary":"An invented bakery, drawn up one idea at a time: the user and a need, the chain down from it, then evolution left to right, one part drifting, and a decision the map changes. First version for sherpa.d to test with cold readers.","beats":[{"id":"b1","narration":"A Wardley map shows what something is made of, and how mature each part is. In eight short steps you will see how to read one, using a made-up bakery.","visual":{"kind":"title","text":"What a Wardley map is"},"facts":["s2"]},{"id":"b2","narration":"Start with a person and what they need. Ana wants fresh bread at her door. Everything on the map exists to meet that one need, so it goes at the top.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":0,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 1 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 0 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b3","narration":"What does her need depend on? First, something she can see and use: an order page. The higher a part sits, the more visible it is to the person it serves.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":12,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 2 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 12 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b4","narration":"The order page depends on delivery, and on bread that is actually baked. Each part depends on the ones below it, and Ana never sees them.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":24,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 3 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 24 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b5","narration":"Baking needs an oven and flour, and the oven needs electricity. Now we have a chain, from what Ana sees at the top to what is hidden at the bottom.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":36,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 4 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 36 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b6","narration":"Now the second idea, left to right. Parts mature. On the left, new and one of a kind, like this bakery's recipe. On the right, everyday and cheap, like electricity. The map spreads out.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":48,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 5 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 48 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b7","narration":"Parts do not stay still. Delivery services become everyday, and delivery drifts to the right. Whatever is already everyday is rarely worth building for yourself.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":60,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 6 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 60 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b8","narration":"Here is the decision the map changes. Do not build your own delivery. Use an everyday one, and spend your effort on the recipe, the part on the left that only you can do.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":72,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 7 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 72 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b9","narration":"That is a Wardley map. Two ways in from here: edit this map and make it your own, or watch how a map changes over time, one dated move at a time.","visual":{"kind":"svg","src":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg","at":84,"play":12,"alt":"Animated map of an invented bakery; step 8 of 8","note":"Seek the inline SVG to second 84 and play 12 seconds; each step is 12 seconds so the narration can be heard.","src_phone":"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg"},"facts":["s1"]},{"id":"b10","narration":"Next time: how maps help you choose, with the climate around a market and the habits of good teams. Or open the editor and map your own situation.","visual":{"kind":"list","items":["Edit this map and make it your own","Watch a map change over time, one dated move at a time","Next lesson: climate and doctrine"]},"facts":["s2"]}],"sources":[{"id":"s1","title":"The history map: the eight steps and their captions","url":"https://github.com/PrompTugal/PrompTugal__News__Website/blob/dev/board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.json","read":"2026-11-22"},{"id":"s2","title":"sherpa.d: the first five minutes of the Wardley Maps site","url":"https://github.com/PrompTugal/PrompTugal__News__Website/blob/dev/board/team/sherpa.d/needs/wardley-maps-site.md","read":"2026-11-22"}]}</script>
 <script id="svgs" type="application/json">{"board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.svg":"\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 760\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What a Wardley map is\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">\n\u003crect width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#111\">What a Wardley map is\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#444\">An invented bakery, made up to teach with. Where a part sits is a judgement, not a measurement.\u003c/text>\n\u003crect x=\"70\" y=\"80\" width=\"990\" height=\"490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\"/>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4929;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"76\" y=\"588\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Genesis\u003c/text>\n\u003cline x1=\"317.5\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"317.5\" y2=\"570\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"323.5\" y=\"588\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Custom-built\u003c/text>\n\u003cline x1=\"565\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"565\" y2=\"570\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"571\" y=\"588\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Product (+ rental)\u003c/text>\n\u003cline x1=\"812.5\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"812.5\" y2=\"570\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"818.5\" y=\"588\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Commodity (+ utility)\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.0001;0.0081;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 94.7;565 94.7;565 94.7;565 94.7\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.0001;0.0081;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">Ana wants fresh bread at her door\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1293;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 168.2;565 168.2;565 168.2;565 168.2;367 168.2;367 168.2\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1293;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">An order page she can use\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;0.6141;0.6545;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 266.2;565 266.2;565 266.2;565 266.2;614.5 266.2;614.5 266.2;842.2 266.2;842.2 266.2\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;0.6141;0.6545;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">Delivery\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 325;565 325;565 325;565 325;268 325;268 325\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">The recipe and the baking\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 374;565 374;565 374;565 374;763 374;763 374\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">The oven\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 452.4;565 452.4;565 452.4;565 452.4;881.8 452.4;881.8 452.4\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">Flour\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"565 530.8;565 530.8;565 530.8;565 530.8;1010.5 530.8;1010.5 530.8\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"7\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext x=\"12\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111\">Electricity\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Start with a person and what they need. Ana wants fresh bread at her door. Everything on\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>the map exists to meet that one need, so it goes at the top.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 1 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>What does her need depend on? First, something she can see and use: an order page. The\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>higher a part sits, the more visible it is to the person it serves.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 2 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>The order page depends on delivery, and on bread that is actually baked. Each part\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>depends on the ones below it, and Ana never sees them.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 3 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Baking needs an oven and flour, and the oven needs electricity. Now we have a chain,\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>from what Ana sees at the top to what is hidden at the bottom.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 4 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Now the second idea, left to right. Parts mature. On the left, new and one of a kind,\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>like this bakery's recipe. On the right, everyday and cheap, like electricity. The map\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"710\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>spreads out.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 5 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Parts do not stay still. Delivery services become everyday, and delivery drifts to the\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>right. Whatever is already everyday is rarely worth building for yourself.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 6 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Here is the decision the map changes. Do not build your own delivery. Use an everyday\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>one, and spend your effort on the recipe, the part on the left that only you can do.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 7 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"664\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>That is a Wardley map. Two ways in from here: edit this map and make it your own, or\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"687\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>watch how a map changes over time, one dated move at a time.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 8 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"754\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Invented example for teaching. Positions are a judgement.\u003c/text>\n\u003c/svg>\n","board/team/cartographer.d/maps/wardley-explainer.history.phone.svg":"\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 700\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What a Wardley map is\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">\n\u003crect width=\"420\" height=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#111\">What a Wardley map is\u003c/text>\n\u003crect x=\"14\" y=\"86\" width=\"392\" height=\"364\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\"/>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4929;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"20\" y=\"468\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Genesis\u003c/text>\n\u003cline x1=\"112\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"450\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"118\" y=\"468\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Custom-built\u003c/text>\n\u003cline x1=\"210\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"450\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"216\" y=\"468\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Product\u003c/text>\n\u003cline x1=\"308\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"450\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n\u003ctext x=\"314\" y=\"468\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Commodity\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.0001;0.0081;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 123.4;210 123.4;210 123.4;210 123.4\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.0001;0.0081;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"-13\" y=\"-3\">Ana wants fresh\u003c/tspan>\u003ctspan x=\"-13\" y=\"18\">bread at her door\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1293;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 170.2;210 170.2;210 170.2;210 170.2;131.6 170.2;131.6 170.2\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1293;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"13\" y=\"-3\">An order page she\u003c/tspan>\u003ctspan x=\"13\" y=\"18\">can use\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;0.6141;0.6545;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 232.6;210 232.6;210 232.6;210 232.6;229.6 232.6;229.6 232.6;319.8 232.6;319.8 232.6\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;0.6141;0.6545;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"-13\" y=\"7\">Delivery\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 270;210 270;210 270;210 270;92.4 270;92.4 270\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2505;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"13\" y=\"-3\">The recipe and\u003c/tspan>\u003ctspan x=\"13\" y=\"18\">the baking\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 301.2;210 301.2;210 301.2;210 301.2;288.4 301.2;288.4 301.2\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"-13\" y=\"7\">The oven\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 351.1;210 351.1;210 351.1;210 351.1;335.4 351.1;335.4 351.1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"-13\" y=\"7\">Flour\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003cg opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003cg>\u003canimateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"210 401;210 401;210 401;210 401;386.4 401;386.4 401\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3717;0.4929;0.5333;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n\u003ccircle r=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a5f\"/>\u003ctext text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#111\">\u003ctspan x=\"-13\" y=\"7\">Electricity\u003c/tspan>\u003c/text>\u003c/g>\u003c/g>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Start with a person and what they need.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Ana wants fresh bread at her door.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Everything on the map exists to meet\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>that one need, so it goes at the top.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"1\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1172;0.1212;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 1 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>What does her need depend on? First,\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>something she can see and use: an order\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>page. The higher a part sits, the more\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>visible it is to the person it serves.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.1212;0.1253;0.2384;0.2424;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 2 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>The order page depends on delivery, and\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>on bread that is actually baked. Each\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>part depends on the ones below it, and\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Ana never sees them.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.2424;0.2465;0.3596;0.3636;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 3 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Baking needs an oven and flour, and the\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>oven needs electricity. Now we have a\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>chain, from what Ana sees at the top to\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>what is hidden at the bottom.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.3636;0.3677;0.4808;0.4848;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 4 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Now the second idea, left to right.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Parts mature. On the left, new and one\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>of a kind, like this bakery's recipe. On\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>the right, everyday and cheap, like\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>electricity. The map spreads out.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.4848;0.4889;0.6020;0.6061;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 5 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Parts do not stay still. Delivery\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>services become everyday, and delivery\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>drifts to the right. Whatever is already\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>everyday is rarely worth building for\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>yourself.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.6061;0.6101;0.7232;0.7273;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 6 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Here is the decision the map changes. Do\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>not build your own delivery. Use an\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>everyday one, and spend your effort on\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>the recipe, the part on the left that\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>only you can do.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.7273;0.7313;0.8444;0.8485;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 7 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"504\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>That is a Wardley map. Two ways in from\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"528\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>here: edit this map and make it your\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>own, or watch how a map changes over\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"576\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#111\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>time, one dated move at a time.\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"692\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#666\" opacity=\"0\">\u003canimate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0.0000;0.8485;0.8525;1.0000\" dur=\"99s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>Step 8 of 8\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext x=\"14\" y=\"670\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Invented example for teaching. Positions are a judgement.\u003c/text>\n\u003c/svg>\n"}</script>
